      <div class="hc-container implementation-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="hc-eyebrow">Section XI · Code Implementation</span>
          <h2 id="implementation-title">Implementation Guide</h2>
          <p>
            The single locked source of truth lives in <code>DESIGN.md</code> and <code>src/styles/global.css</code>.
            When documentation and shipped CSS disagree, verify the shipped stylesheets first and keep
            tokens strictly synchronized.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="do-dont-grid">
          <article class="do-card">
            <h3>Do</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Use <code>--hc-*</code> CSS variables for all surfaces and borders.</li>
              <li>Maintain 68–75ch optimal measure for reading columns.</li>
              <li>Keep hairline apparatus rules at 1px thickness.</li>
              <li>Run Arabic text at <code>2.05</code> line height with <code>lang="ar"</code>.</li>
              <li>Present historical jarḥ statements in neutral apparatus ink.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="dont-card">
            <h3>Do Not</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Never use green/red traffic-light grading badges anywhere.</li>
              <li>Never set text below the 12px (0.75rem) accessibility floor.</li>
              <li>Never wash entire viewports in gold background fills.</li>
              <li>Never use italic display headlines or italic emphasis words.</li>
              <li>Never hide critical research text behind abstract gradient blobs.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

